---
import MakerLayout from '../../layouts/MakerLayout.astro';
import tools from '../../data/ai-tools.json';
---
<MakerLayout title="PARADOX AI — AI Studio, Free AI Tools & Developer Workbench" description="PARADOX AI Studio helps with resumes, interviews, study, content and code, plus fast developer AI utilities.">
<main class="ai-v2">
<section class="ai-hero"><div class="ai-top"><span>PARADOX / AI</span><span>01 — WORKBENCH</span></div><div class="ai-hero-grid"><div><p class="ai-kicker"><i></i> REAL WORKFLOWS · NOT PROMPT DECORATION</p><h1>Make AI<br/><em>do the work.</em></h1><p class="ai-lead">A practical AI workbench for job applications, interview prep, study, content and code. Then a full toolkit for the smaller jobs around your model.</p><a class="ai-enter" href="/ai-studio/">OPEN AI STUDIO ↗</a><a class="ai-secondary" href="#toolkit">Explore developer tools ↓</a></div><div class="ai-card"><span>FEATURED</span><strong>AI<br/>STUDIO</strong><p>Resume → job match<br/>Notes → revision pack<br/>Code → diagnosis</p><a href="/ai-studio/">Launch workspace ↗</a></div></div></section>
<section class="ai-marquee"><span>RESUME</span><b>×</b><span>INTERVIEW</span><b>×</b><span>STUDY</span><b>×</b><span>CODE</span><b>×</b><span>CONTENT</span><b>×</b><span>AI ENGINE</span></section>
<section class="ai-studio-preview"><div class="ai-section-head"><div><span>02 / WHY</span><h2>Five jobs people<br/><em>repeat.</em></h2></div><p>The value is not “AI chat”. The value is taking a real input and returning a finished artifact.</p></div><div class="workflow-row"><a href="/ai-studio/"><b>01</b><strong>Resume Tailor</strong><small>JD → match score → rewritten bullets</small></a><a href="/ai-studio/"><b>02</b><strong>Interview Coach</strong><small>Role → realistic questions → answer plan</small></a><a href="/ai-studio/"><b>03</b><strong>Study Engine</strong><small>Notes → flashcards → exam pack</small></a><a href="/ai-studio/"><b>04</b><strong>Content Studio</strong><small>Idea → polished publishable draft</small></a><a href="/ai-studio/"><b>05</b><strong>Code Fixer</strong><small>Error → diagnosis → corrected code</small></a></div></section>
<section class="ai-toolkit" id="toolkit"><div class="ai-section-head"><div><span>03 / TOOLKIT</span><h2>Then the<br/><em>small stuff.</em></h2></div><p>Prompt engineering, JSON, tokens, regex, Base64, JWTs and cost calculations remain useful when they're subordinate to the bigger workflows.</p></div><div class="ai-grid">{tools.map((t,i)=><a class="ai-tool" data-search={t.label+' '+t.description+' '+t.keywords.join(' ')} href={`/ai/${t.slug}/`}><span>{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><h3>{t.label}</h3><p>{t.description}</p><b>OPEN ↗</b></a>)}</div></section>
<section class="ai-radar-cta"><div><span>04 / LIVE INTELLIGENCE</span><h2>Know what the<br/><em>models are doing.</em></h2><p>PARADOX already has public model, GitHub and AI-news signals. Turn that into a live research surface instead of a static directory.</p></div><a href="/ai-radar/">OPEN AI RADAR ↗</a></section>
</main>
<style>
.ai-v2{--ink:#0b0e0d;--paper:#f2efe6;--line:#bdb9af;--acid:#ddff33;--red:#ff583d;max-width:1440px;margin:auto;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);overflow:hidden}.ai-hero{padding:22px clamp(18px,4vw,62px) 80px;min-height:78vh}.ai-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:13px;font:9px 'DM Mono';letter-spacing:.14em}.ai-hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr .45fr;gap:7vw;align-items:center;min-height:68vh}.ai-kicker,.ai-section-head>div>span{font:9px 'DM Mono';letter-spacing:.14em}.ai-kicker i{display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:var(--red);border-radius:50%;margin-right:8px}.ai-hero h1{font:700 clamp(86px,13vw,180px)/.71 'DM Sans';letter-spacing:-.09em;margin:27px 0 42px}.ai-hero h1 em,.ai-section-head h2 em,.ai-radar-cta h2 em{font-family:'Instrument Serif';font-weight:400}.ai-lead{font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;color:#5c5e56;max-width:650px}.ai-enter{display:inline-block;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;padding:15px 18px;margin-top:26px;font:9px 'DM Mono';letter-spacing:.1em}.ai-enter:hover{background:var(--red)}.ai-secondary{display:inline-block;margin-left:13px;font:9px 'DM Mono';text-decoration:underline}.ai-card{background:var(--ink);color:#fff;padding:30px;min-height:410px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;box-shadow:22px 22px 0 var(--red)}.ai-card span{font:8px 'DM Mono';color:#8f948d}.ai-card strong{font:700 74px/.72 'DM Sans';letter-spacing:-.08em}.ai-card p{font:11px/1.7 'DM Mono';color:#aeb2ab}.ai-card a{color:#fff;border-top:1px solid #373b37;padding-top:13px;font:9px 'DM Mono'}.ai-marquee{height:76px;background:var(--acid);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-around;font:700 clamp(17px,3vw,36px) 'DM Sans';white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden}.ai-marquee b{font-weight:400}.ai-studio-preview,.ai-toolkit{padding:clamp(90px,11vw,160px) clamp(18px,4vw,62px)}.ai-section-head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr .55fr;gap:6vw;align-items:end;margin-bottom:50px}.ai-section-head h2{font:700 clamp(60px,8vw,118px)/.76 'DM Sans';letter-spacing:-.08em;margin:18px 0 0}.ai-section-head p{max-width:470px;color:#63655e;line-height:1.6}.workflow-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line)}.workflow-row a{background:#fbf9f2;padding:22px;min-height:220px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;transition:.2s}.workflow-row a:hover{background:#fff;transform:translateY(-6px)}.workflow-row b{font:9px 'DM Mono';color:var(--red)}.workflow-row strong{margin-top:auto;font-size:18px}.workflow-row small{color:#777970;font-size:11px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:7px}.ai-toolkit{background:#121413;color:#fff}.ai-toolkit .ai-section-head p{color:#a6aaa3}.ai-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:#383b37}.ai-tool{background:#1a1c1b;color:#fff;padding:20px;min-height:205px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;transition:.18s}.ai-tool:hover{background:#242724;transform:translateY(-4px)}.ai-tool>span{font:9px 'DM Mono';color:#666}.ai-tool h3{font-size:17px;margin-top:auto}.ai-tool p{font-size:11px;color:#9b9f98;line-height:1.45}.ai-tool b{font:8px 'DM Mono';margin-top:12px}.ai-radar-cta{padding:100px clamp(18px,4vw,62px);background:#e6e1d6;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:40px;align-items:end;border-top:1px solid var(--ink)}.ai-radar-cta h2{font:700 clamp(60px,8vw,115px)/.76 'DM Sans';letter-spacing:-.08em;margin:18px 0}.ai-radar-cta p{max-width:540px;color:#666860}.ai-radar-cta a{border:1px solid var(--ink);padding:15px 18px;font:9px 'DM Mono';white-space:nowrap}.ai-radar-cta a:hover{background:var(--ink);color:#fff}@media(max-width:1000px){.ai-hero-grid,.ai-section-head{grid-template-columns:1fr}.ai-card{max-width:520px}.workflow-row{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.ai-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.ai-radar-cta{display:block}}@media(max-width:600px){.ai-top span:nth-child(2){display:none}.ai-hero h1{font-size:78px}.ai-secondary{display:block;margin:17px 0 0}.workflow-row,.ai-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.workflow-row a{min-height:180px}.ai-tool{min-height:170px}.ai-radar-cta h2{font-size:65px}}
</style>
</MakerLayout>
